000100*================================================================
000200* CLMREC   CLAIM MASTER RECORD             CORV.CLMMAST  LRECL 300
000300*
000400* READ ONLINE BY CLMINQ0 (TRANSACTION CLMI) AND IN BATCH BY
000500* CLMHIST. THE SYSTEM OF RECORD FOR CLAIMS MOVED TO POSTGRES
000600* (claims.claim) IN 2024; CLMMAST IS NOW FED NIGHTLY FROM
000700* claimsdb SO THE CICS INQUIRY KEEPS WORKING UNTIL THE NEW
000800* GET /v1/claims/{id}/summary REPLACES IT (STRANGLER).
000900* CLM-FRAUD-SCORE IS THE fraud-scoring SCORE, 0.000 TO 1.000.
001000*================================================================
001100 01  CLM-RECORD.
001200     05  CLM-NUMBER              PIC X(14).
001300     05  CLM-POL-NUMBER          PIC X(12).
001400     05  CLM-LINE-CODE           PIC X(03).
001500     05  CLM-STATUS              PIC X(03).
001600         88  CLM-REGISTERED      VALUE 'REG'.
001700         88  CLM-TRIAGED         VALUE 'TRI'.
001800         88  CLM-APPROVED        VALUE 'APP'.
001900         88  CLM-PAID            VALUE 'PAI'.
002000         88  CLM-CLOSED          VALUE 'CLS'.
002100         88  CLM-REJECTED        VALUE 'REJ'.
002200     05  CLM-LOSS-DATE           PIC 9(08).
002300     05  CLM-REPORTED-DATE       PIC 9(08).
002400     05  CLM-CLOSED-DATE         PIC 9(08).
002500     05  CLM-LOSS-CAUSE          PIC X(06).
002600     05  CLM-CLAIMANT-NAME       PIC X(40).
002700     05  CLM-CLAIMANT-PHONE      PIC X(15).
002800     05  CLM-INJURY-FLAG         PIC X(01).
002900     05  CLM-RESERVE-AMT         PIC S9(09)V99 COMP-3.
003000     05  CLM-PAID-AMT            PIC S9(09)V99 COMP-3.
003100     05  CLM-EXCESS-AMT          PIC S9(05)V99 COMP-3.
003200     05  CLM-FRAUD-SCORE         PIC 9V999.
003300     05  CLM-ADJUSTER-ID         PIC X(08).
003400     05  CLM-CURRENCY            PIC X(03).
003500     05  CLM-DESCRIPTION         PIC X(120).
003600     05  FILLER                  PIC X(31).
